'''Turkey''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it from the [[Turkey Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux during the [[Thanksgiving Event 2023|2023 Thanksgiving Event]]. It is now only obtainable through [[trading]] as the event has since ended  

== Appearance ==
It has a thick brown top and a white slim bottom shaped like a bone, resembling a turkey leg, hence the name. 

== Trivia ==
* This is the first and, currently, only Thanksgiving themed godly weapon to be introduced into [[Murder Mystery 2]]. 
* Turkey has an extremely rare chance of having a bite mark taken out of it. The bite mark only appears once it is thrown and then it is hidden a few seconds after its throw.
* In early July 2025, a glitch was discovered; if you use the [[Dual Wield]] effect and equip Turkey, you can randomly move around the map at high speed.
* This, [[Candy]], [[BattleAxe]], [[BattleAxe II]], [[Bat]], [[Evergreen]], [[Heart Wand]], and [[Embersickle]] are the only godly "[[knives]]" that do not resemble knives.
* Turkey has highest value as godly weapon purchasable from gamepass.

